flowchart TB
  runtime[Run、Step、Attempt、Tool 与资源] --> db[(SQLite、Event、Outbox 与 Blob)]
  runtime --> logs[本地日志与固定诊断字段]
  runtime --> lifecycle[LoopLifecycle 观察点]
  runtime --> trace[可选 OpenTelemetry<br/>默认不启用 exporter]
  db --> inspect[按 ID 读取事实、配置快照与原始结果]
  inspect --> tests[对应的单元、契约、集成与原生验证]
  tests --> real[真实 Provider 与 Desktop 人工验收]
  real --> evaluation[真实任务与长任务质量评测]
  evaluation --> distribution[Bundle、安装、升级、签名与发布验证]
  logs -.故障定位.-> inspect
  lifecycle -.内部观察.-> logs
  distribution --> report[分别报告每项证据与未验证边界]
